      "text": "**TODO editor \u2014 remaining scope: add-TODO form, edit card text, and drag-between-columns write-back. Checkbox toggling shipped (see Phase 2 live board).**\n`#feature` `#editor` `#kanban`\n`TODO.md:L157`",
